    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T16:32:00Z",
    "body": "Decision: this PR stays a held draft. The levels-plus-deepest plane set is rejected, because it lost 19 part-true `ShankHit` collisions.\n\nThe design and the gate for the next head are in the decision on #3615: keep every plane, and add an exact Y-slab index to each cached slice in `Rest::surface_before`. The result must equal `Region::contains` bit for bit.\n\nThe PR is ready to rework on the same branch. Do not merge before the equivalence pin passes on the sloped and stepped fixtures and the reached heavy sim and verify lanes pass.\n",
