    "body": "Ready to merge. Class: single PR (no wave). Relies on the review at `89ab6519` (exactness by construction, slab proof, `ramp_at(500,36)` equality to the all-plane reference, superset mutation red) and on the author's targeted `app heavy: verify` run (450 s) named in the body.\n\nThis is the fix for #3615 and it unblocks #3577. Found no `unwrap`/`expect`/`panic!`, every index bounds-safe, files under 400 lines.\n",
